 "description": "Busy makes free, private tools for work and life, in suites: Busy Business (thirteen tools for small businesses and freelancers: invoices and quotes, time, receipts, money, clients, projects, documents, a brand kit, subscriptions, trips, stock and a marketing studio), Busy Growth (tools to grow your career, coming soon), Busy Home (tools for household paperwork, coming soon) and Busy Games (free daily brain games). Each suite is a free app for Mac and Windows, or runs in the browser, and keeps everything in the owner's own folder, with no account and no subscription. Each suite can have a paid AI expert: Olaf for business, Ivy for professional growth, Juno for household paperwork.",
